{"id":287,"frontend_id":287,"title":"Value in Linked List","slug":"value-in-linked-list","difficulty":"Easy","pattern_category":"linked-list","tags":["dataset","linked list"],"company_tags":["Apple","Amazon","Adobe","Zoho"],"ac_rate":"73.8%","statement":"# Problem Statement\nGiven the head of a singly linked list and an integer target, return 1 if the target exists in the linked list, otherwise return 0.\n\n## Constraints\n- -100 <= target <= 100\n- -100 <= Node.val <= 100\n- 1 <= length of linked list <= 100\n\n### Examples\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n**Input:** `head = {\"val\": 1, \"next\": {\"val\": 2, \"next\": null}}, target = 1`\n\n**Output:** `0`\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n**Input:** `head = {\"val\": 1, \"next\": {\"val\": 2, \"next\": {\"val\": 3, \"next\": null}}}, target = 4`\n\n**Output:** `0`\n","hints":[],"starter_code_python":"class ListNode:\n    def __init__(self, val=0, next=None):\n        self.val = val\n        self.next = next\n\nclass Solution:\n    def solve(self, head: ListNode, target: int) -> int:\n        # Write your code here\n        current = head\n        while current:\n            if current.val == target:\n                return 1\n            current = current.next\n        return 0","example_test_cases":[{"stdin":"{\"head\": {\"val\": 1, \"next\": {\"val\": 2, \"next\": null}}, \"target\": 1}","expected_stdout":"0","is_hidden":false,"order":0},{"stdin":"{\"head\": {\"val\": 1, \"next\": {\"val\": 2, \"next\": {\"val\": 3, \"next\": null}}}, \"target\": 4}","expected_stdout":"0","is_hidden":false,"order":1}],"hidden_test_cases":[{"stdin":"{\"head\": {\"val\": -1, \"next\": null}, \"target\": -1}","expected_stdout":"0","is_hidden":true,"order":2},{"stdin":"{\"head\": {\"val\": 0, \"next\": null}, \"target\": 1}","expected_stdout":"0","is_hidden":true,"order":3},{"stdin":"{\"head\": {\"val\": 1, \"next\": {\"val\": 1, \"next\": {\"val\": 1, \"next\": null}}}, \"target\": 1}","expected_stdout":"0","is_hidden":true,"order":4},{"stdin":"{\"head\"